---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---

<Base
  title="Allen · a small universe, under construction"
  description="Allen studies aerospace engineering at UC Berkeley and builds rockets and software. This site is becoming a galaxy you can fly through."
>
  <p class="eyebrow">Status: building the launchpad</p>
  <h1>A small universe is under construction.</h1>

  <p class="lede">
    I'm Allen. I study aerospace engineering at UC Berkeley, and I build rockets, software, and a
    bot that takes the card game Canadian Fish far too seriously.
  </p>

  <p>
    This site is turning into a galaxy you can fly through: every solar system is something I care
    about, and every planet is a project. Until launch day, here is where to find me.
  </p>

  <ul class="links">
    <li>
      <a href={site.socials.github} rel="me noopener">
        GitHub
      </a>
      <span>where the projects live</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href={site.socials.linkedin} rel="me noopener">
        LinkedIn
      </a>
      <span>the formal version</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href={site.elsewhere.days2meet} rel="noopener">
        Days2Meet
      </a>
      <span>a scheduling poll I built because when2meet needed a sequel</span>
    </li>
  </ul>
</Base>
